OL,3,GNEWSA'Our number-one album was worth
OL,4,Athe hard work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lead singer of synth-pop band Deco
OL,7,Fsays the success of their latest album
OL,8,Fhas made "all those hard times worth
OL,9,Fit".
OL,11,FDreamhouse, the Staffordshire group's
OL,12,Fsecond record, was released in October
OL,13,Fand reached number one on the official
OL,14,Findependent album breakers chart.
OL,16,FIt was also in the top 11 of the
OL,17,Findependent, record store, homegrown,
OL,18,Fdownloads, cassettes, CDs, sales and
OL,19,Fphysical albums charts.
