OL,3,GNEWSA'Our number-one album was worth
OL,4,Athe hard work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMax Kendall, lead singer, said it meant
OL,7,Fa lot to the band and "eclipsed" the
OL,8,Fmoments they wished they were "doing
OL,9,Fsomething else", but it had yet to sink
OL,10,Fin.
